cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the preprint below."
title: "AMPPredictionTabPFN: tabular in-context learning for multi-activity antimicrobial peptide profiling"
abstract: >-
  Sequence-only multi-activity antimicrobial peptide prediction on the ESCAPE
  benchmark: 330 interpretable sequence descriptors paired with TabPFN, compared
  across five multi-label transforms (binary relevance, label powerset,
  classifier chain, ensemble classifier chains, probabilistic classifier chain).
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/singla-lab/AMPPredictionTabPFN"
