  - family-names: Singh
    given-names: Juhi
    affiliation: "Department of Bioengineering, Indian Institute of Science, Bengaluru"
  - family-names: Singla
    given-names: Jitin
    affiliation: "Department of Biosciences and Bioengineering, Indian Institute of Technology Roorkee"
keywords:
  - antimicrobial peptides
  - multi-label classification
  - tabular foundation models
  - TabPFN
  - ESCAPE benchmark
  - assay prioritization

